22:42.453 --> 22:44.704
<i>Hey, show me even more</i>

22:44.705 --> 22:46.289
<i>My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping</i>

22:46.290 --> 22:47.916
<i>Complaint whether
we sober upward</i>

22:47.917 --> 22:49.960
<i>For now, let's ride
